Audience:
•	DS leads and SMEs socializing experiment behavior and findings
•	teammates maintaining scripts and interpreting outputs
•	architecture and dev teams preparing runtime and production handoff
Primary goals:
•	explain the full data workflow from candidate rows to final outputs
•	identify main entry scripts, helper modules, and source systems
•	summarize preliminary outcomes and known hardening gaps
